        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "The hottest spot in USC village! We got Pastrami sandwitch, matcha latte and Hong Kong tea latte, the sandwitch is delicious !! full of meat and the portion is big.\nThe space inside the store is small and noisy, it's better eat outside, enjoying the sun and breeze.\n\nI tried the breakfast burrito before, it's tasty too!\nDefinately would come back and try different meal next time.\nLove Dulce as always ",
